# --- OpenAPI drift gate (V12-L-12) ---
# ``frontend/openapi.json`` is regenerated by
# ``scripts/dump_openapi.py`` in CI's drift-gate step. Tracking it in
# git is redundant — the gate fails the build if it's stale, and a
# committed copy would just create merge conflicts every time a
# router signature changes.
frontend/openapi.json

